0; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:35:53 +08:00\">19h 21m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>闲鱼上买过一次，经常超时和失败，明显就是超卖导致中转服务抗不住了，反馈用不了，商家也是直接来一句是我自己的问题，不肯退钱，投诉结果闲鱼小法庭还判商家赢了，气不过找人工客服赔偿拿回了钱，然后把闲鱼注销删除了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065881\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89a8/20e8/612576_normal.png?m=1778563544\" alt=\"gochendong\" data-uid=\"612576\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gochendong\">gochendong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:38:28 +08:00\">19h 18m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>无中生有又来了 哪句话是怒骂？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065900\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/daa8027f3eba58ed4dbe7e79604b9a2c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MX0kLK\" data-uid=\"122542\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MX0kLK\">MX0kLK</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:41:52 +08:00\">19h 15m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                  