          </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065990\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89a8/20e8/612576_normal.png?m=1778563544\" alt=\"gochendong\" data-uid=\"612576\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>54</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gochendong\">gochendong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:10:26 +08:00\">18h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>楼主充了 10 块钱看给你们急的, 要不你们远程教他怎么用? 又是看不起这看不起那的, 退款走卡网申诉, 我没处理过, 流程未知</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066071\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/49d6fcc3fd0f0bbdb22068e4ca8c4822?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Carver9527\" data-uid=\"526487\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>61</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Carver9527\">Carver9527</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:29:38 +08:00\">18h 27m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/cloudzhou\">cloudzhou</a> 根据《生成式人工智能服务管理暂行办法》第十七条 提供具有舆论属性或者社会动员能力的生成式人工智能服务的，应当按照国家有关规定开展安全评估，并按照《互联网信息服务算法推荐管理规定》履行算法备案和变更、注销备案手续。</p><p>第十八条 使用者发现生成式人工智能服务不符合法律、行政法规和本办法规定的，有权向有关主管部门投诉、举报。</p><p>提供海外大模型代理服务，是涉嫌违法的。</p><p>我不懂这个站长为什么这么嚣张，如果肉身在国内，你是真的会被请去喝茶的。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066099\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2803aebc6b39ed4ea3140a28febf01a5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"frankies\" data-uid=\"556542\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/frankies\">frankies</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:36:33 +08:00\">18h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中转站我都是薅羊毛分币不花的，默认中转站都是掺水，主力只买 GPT 官方订阅的。你还真给中转充钱呐。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066157\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/100a/c6ca/267444_normal.png?m=1758088698\" alt=\"xingye163\" data-uid=\"267444\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>66</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xingye163\">xingye163</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:44:47 +08:00\">18h 12m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>既然啥都不服务，留个客服入口做什么，属于是服务差还蠢，既然能主动拉黑，这里又辩解说不退款是人家没主动申请，双标到这种程度也是神了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n      